editor.nod_help.math.extra=<h2>Math ç®€è¦è¯´æ˜Ž</h2><p><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a> ä½¿ç”¨ <code>ans</code> è®¡ç®—ã€‚ç¬¬ä¸€è¡Œä¸­ <code>ans</code> æ˜¯è¾“å…¥å€¼ï¼›åŽç»­è¡Œä¸­å®ƒæ˜¯ä¸Šä¸€æ¬¡çš„ç»“æžœã€‚</p><div class="notice"><b>ç»“æž„:</b> å…ˆé€‰æ‹©è®¡ç®—ç±»åž‹ï¼Œå†å†™å¯¹åº”çš„ syntaxã€‚è¾ƒå¤§çš„å…¬å¼å¯ä»¥ä½¿ç”¨æ‹¬å·æˆ–å¤šè¡Œ <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a>ã€‚</div><div class="math-flow"><span class="math-pill">1. åŸºæœ¬è¿ç®—</span><span class="math-pill">2. å‡½æ•°å’Œå¸¸é‡</span><span class="math-pill">3. å¤æ‚å…¬å¼</span><span class="math-pill">4. å¾®ç§¯åˆ†ï¼šdiffã€integralã€limit</span></div><details open><summary>åŸºæœ¬è¿ç®—</summary><table><tr><th>ç›®æ ‡</th><th>Syntax</th><th>ç¤ºä¾‹</th></tr><tr><td>+</td><td><code>math ans + number</code></td><td><code>math ans + 32</code></td></tr><tr><td>-</td><td><code>math ans - number</code></td><td><code>math ans - 10</code></td></tr><tr><td>*</td><td><code>math ans * factor</code></td><td><code>math ans * 1.8</code></td></tr><tr><td>/</td><td><code>math ans / factor</code></td><td><code>math ans / 1.95583</code></td></tr></table><pre>Name Euro to cents&#13;&#10;input1 Euro&#13;&#10;input2 Cents&#13;&#10;format #.00&#13;&#10;math ans * 100&#13;&#10;end</pre></details><details><summary>å‡½æ•°å’Œå¸¸é‡</summary><table><tr><th>Groep</th><th>Syntax</th><th>è¯´æ˜Ž</th></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td><code>math ans^2</code> or <code>math pow(ans,3)</code></td><td>Square, cube.</td></tr><tr><td>Root</td><td><code>math sqrt(ans)</code></td><td>Can be used inside formulas.</td></tr><tr><td>Pi/e</td><td><code>math pi * ans^2</code><br><code>math e^ans</code></td><td>Circle and exponential.</td></tr><tr><td>Degrees</td><td><code>math sind(ans)</code><br><code>math cosd(ans)</code></td><td>Use <code>sin/cos/tan</code> for radians.</td></tr></table></details><details><summary>å¤æ‚å…¬å¼</summary><p>å½“è®¡ç®—é¡ºåºå¾ˆé‡è¦æ—¶ä½¿ç”¨æ‹¬å·ã€‚ä¹˜æ³•å§‹ç»ˆç”¨ <code>*</code> æ˜Žç¡®å†™å‡ºã€‚</p><pre>math sqrt(ans^2 + 25)&#13;&#10;math ((ans + 10) * 2) / 3&#13;&#10;math ans * (1 + 0.04)^5</pre><h3>ç¤ºä¾‹ï¼šå‹¾è‚¡å®šç†</h3><div class="mathml-formula"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="inline"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math></div><pre>Name Hypotenuse&#13;&#10;input1 Side a&#13;&#10;input2 Side c&#13;&#10;format #.00&#13;&#10;math sqrt(ans^2 + 25)&#13;&#10;end</pre><p>è¿™é‡Œ <code>ans</code> æ˜¯è¾¹ <code>a</code>ï¼›å¦ä¸€æ¡è¾¹å›ºå®šä¸º <code>5</code>ã€‚</p></details><details><summary>å¾®ç§¯åˆ†ï¼šdiffã€integralã€limit</summary><table><tr><th>ç›®æ ‡</th><th>Syntax</th><th>ç»“æžœ</th></tr><tr><td>Derivative</td><td><code>math diff ans^2</code></td><td>æ•°å€¼æ–œçŽ‡ã€‚</td></tr><tr><td>Integral</td><td><code>math integral 0,1 ans^2</code></td><td>ä»Ž 0 åˆ° 1 çš„æ•°å€¼é¢ç§¯ã€‚</td></tr><tr><td>Limit</td><td><code>math limit 0 sin(ans)/ans</code></td><td>0 é™„è¿‘çš„è¿‘ä¼¼å€¼ã€‚</td></tr></table></details><h2>å¸¸è§é”™è¯¯</h2><ul><li>ä¸è¦å¿˜è®° <code>ans</code>ã€‚</li><li>è§’åº¦è¯·ä½¿ç”¨ <code>sind</code>ã€‚</li><li>å¤æ‚åå‘è½¬æ¢è¯·ä½¿ç”¨ <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:reverse"><code>reverse</code></a>ã€‚</li></ul>
